- termination, renewal and post-termination obligations;
- data protection, confidentiality, intellectual property and information security;
- audit, reporting, record-keeping and notification duties;
- applicable UK legislation, regulations and industry standards;
- compliance gaps, ambiguities, conflicts and practical risks;
- deadlines, dependencies, remedies and consequences of breach; and
- recommended amendments or compliance actions.

Please also identify the relevant jurisdiction, sector, parties’ roles and any particular concerns. You may redact commercially sensitive or personal information.

